stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> HELD: Seat held all requested seats
    HELD --> CONFIRMED: payment approved + seats confirmed
    HELD --> CANCELLED: customer cancels (seats released)
    HELD --> EXPIRED: hold time passed before payment
    CONFIRMED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    EXPIRED --> [*]

    note right of HELD
        Any other transition is
        rejected with 409
        INVALID_STATE_CHANGE.
        A failed payment leaves
        the booking HELD.
    end note
